# Minimum supported webOS TV version is webOS 6 (Chrome 79).
#
# webOS 1-5 are no longer supported. They were Safari 7/8 (webOS 1-2, via WAM)
# and Chrome 38-68 (webOS 3-5). Dropping them is what allows the build to emit
# ES2019, native fetch, and CSS custom properties without manual fallbacks.
#
# This file is the support matrix of record: the webview engine version is
# determined by the TV's webOS version, not by anything the app can detect.
chrome 79 # webOS 6
chrome 87 # webOS 7 (22)
chrome 94 # webOS 8 (23)
chrome 108 # webOS 9 (24)
chrome 121 # webOS 10 (25)
